    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no\u2014a nameless, abstract, and conspicuously absent villain has drained all color from the world, whatever shall you do? Will you die repeatedly in a futile quest for glory, or will you dip, duck, dodge, dye, and dash your way to victory? How about both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dash of Color is a fast-paced minimalist precision-platformer with occasional puzzle elements. Gameplay focuses on smooth movement and pathfinding through unique levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912540/extras/1dea4d2f3289378abb2cd810ef2c0ce6.poster.avif?t=1734032773\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912540/extras/1dea4d2f3289378abb2cd810ef2c0ce6.webm?t=1734032773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912540/extras/1dea4d2f3289378abb2cd810ef2c0ce6.mp4?t=1734032773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To Dye For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim the colors of the world by standing in a fountain of color, thus dyeing yourself and changing how you perceive the world around you. Platforms and hazards change in response to the player color, with new paths opening up, old ones closing, and whole new sets of challenges appearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Normal levels that offer a variety of challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Hazardous levels that have extra obstacles to test your timing and platforming skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Challenge levels that will truly vex you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Mode with custom spawn points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platinum, Gold, Silver, and Bronze time benchmarks for every level</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no\u2014a nameless, abstract, and conspicuously absent villain has drained all color from the world, whatever shall you do? Will you die repeatedly in a futile quest for glory, or will you dip, duck, dodge, dye, and dash your way to victory? How about both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dash of Color is a fast-paced minimalist precision-platformer with occasional puzzle elements. Gameplay focuses on smooth movement and pathfinding through unique levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912540/extras/1dea4d2f3289378abb2cd810ef2c0ce6.poster.avif?t=1734032773\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912540/extras/1dea4d2f3289378abb2cd810ef2c0ce6.webm?t=1734032773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912540/extras/1dea4d2f3289378abb2cd810ef2c0ce6.mp4?t=1734032773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To Dye For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim the colors of the world by standing in a fountain of color, thus dyeing yourself and changing how you perceive the world around you. Platforms and hazards change in response to the player color, with new paths opening up, old ones closing, and whole new sets of challenges appearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Normal levels that offer a variety of challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Hazardous levels that have extra obstacles to test your timing and platforming skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Challenge levels that will truly vex you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Mode with custom spawn points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platinum, Gold, Silver, and Bronze time benchmarks for every level</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Navigate your way through a world that changes when you do, dodge treacherous obstacles, and race against the clock in A Dash of Color: a fast-paced minimalist precision-platformer with occasional puzzle elements.",
